  "description": "Shared telephony media-stream transport for the Voxa pipeline (VTL-001). A vendor-neutral PipelineSource/PipelineSink pair that runs a phone call over a WebSocket — owning the read/write loops, the barge-in epoch purge, and the 8 kHz↔pipeline resample bridge — and delegates the JSON/base64 wire framing to a small ITelephonyMediaCodec. Includes a G.711 (μ-law) codec. No WebRTC. The Twilio codec lives in Voxa.Transports.Twilio.",
